'''FURIA Female''' (formerly stylized as '''FURIA Esports Female''') was the women's team of the [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] esports organization [[FURIA]].

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2020
|name2=2021
|name3=2022
|name4=2023
|name5=2024
|name6=2025
|name7=2026
|This=7

|content1=
* January 9th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign the former [[Keyd Stars Female]] lineup consisting of [[gabs]], [[goddess]], [[mindle]], [[ninha]], and [[kaah]]. Additionally, [[nandinnn]] is signed as coach. <ref name="furia female sign ex-keyd">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/furiagg/status/1215378012365033473|title=Orgulhosamente anunciamos a nossa equipe feminina de CS:GO!|trans_title=We are proud to announce our CS:GO female team!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2020-01-09|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* February 26th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' bench [[goddess]] and part ways with [[ninha]] as they sign [[GaBi]] and [[izaa]]. <ref name="furia fe change two">{{cite web|url=https://draft5.gg/noticia/gabi-e-izaa-sao-contratadas-pela-furia|title=GaBi e Izaa são contratadas pela FURIA|trans_title=GaBi and Izaa are hired by FURIA|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2020-02-26|author=[[cac0]]|publisher=[[Draft5]]}}</ref>
* May 12th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[mindle]] and [[goddess]] as they sign [[Bizinha]]. <ref name="furia fe add Bizinha">{{cite web|url=https://draft5.gg/noticia/goddess-e-mindle-deixam-furia-fem|title=Goddess e Mindle deixam FURIA fem; bizinha é a quinta player|trans_title=Goddess and Mindle leave FURIA fem; bizinha is the fifth player|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2020-05-12|author=[[Edmilson Junior]]|publisher=[[Draft5]]}}</ref>
* October 27th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' bench [[Bizinha]]. <ref name="bizinha out">{{cite web|url=https://draft5.gg/noticia/infeliz-bizinha-pede-para-ser-colocada-na-reserva-da-furia-feminina|title=Infeliz, bizinha pede para ser colocada na reserva da FURIA feminina|trans_title=Unhappy, Bizinha asks to be placed in the women's FURIA reserve|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2020-10-27|author=[[Gabriel Melo]]|publisher=[[Draft5]]}}</ref>
* October 29th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' acquire [[gabee]] from [[Soberano Team Female]]. <ref name="gabee joins">{{cite web|url=https://draft5.gg/noticia/furia-feminina-contrata-gabee-e-fecha-elenco-para-o-restante-da-temporada|title=FURIA feminina contrata gabee e fecha elenco para o restante da temporada|trans_title=Female FURIA hires gabee and closes cast for the remainder of the season|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2020-10-29|author=[[Pedro Umberto]]|publisher=[[Draft5]]}}</ref>
* December 30th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' release [[Bizinha]]. <ref name="bizinha leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/furia_live/status/1344430269361778690|title=Hoje nos despedimos da @bizinhafps|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @bizinhafps|date=2020-12-30|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* May 12th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[nandinnn]]. <ref name="minus nandinnn">{{cite web|url=https://draft5.gg/noticia/nandinnn-deixa-o-comando-da-furia-feminina-apos-quase-um-ano-e-meio-no-clube|title=nandinnn deixa o comando da FURIA feminina após quase um ano e meio no clube|trans_title=nandinnn leaves female FURIA command after nearly a year and a half at the club|date=2021-05-12|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|publisher=[[Draft5]]|author=[[Gabriel Melo]]}}</ref>
* June 25th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[lrz]] as their new coach. <ref name="lrz joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1408453461725925377|title=Please welcome our new femme CS:GO team Coach, Lorenzo "lrz" Araújo!|date=2021-06-25|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* August 27th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[lrz]] and sign [[segalla]] as his replacement. <ref name="+segalla -lrz">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/furia_live/status/1431323131264872455|title=Gostaríamos de dar as boas vindas ao @segallafps como novo Head Coach da nossa equipe feminina de CS:GO!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=We would like to welcome @segallafps as the new Head Coach of our CS:GO female team!|date=2021-08-27|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* September 14th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[gabs]] as she retires from competitive ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]''. <ref name="-gabs">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/gabsfreindorfer/status/1437808854461558787|title=APOSENTADA E PENSIONISTA|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=RETIRED AND PENSIONER|date=2021-09-14|author=[[gabs]]}}</ref>
* September 15th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[olga]]. <ref name="+olga">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1438165356762341385|title=Agora a @olgacsgo é FURIA!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Now @olgacsgo is FURIA!|date=2021-09-15|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* February 11th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' bench [[gabee]] and sign [[mari]] as her replacement. <ref name="gabee bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/gabeecsgo/status/1492161446075064320|title=Por decisão própria, não faço mais parte da line titular de CS:GO FEM da FURIA, mas NÃO estou F/A e sigo representando a organização que tanto amo|trans_title=By my own decision, I am no longer part of FURIA's CS:GO FEM starting lineup, but I am NOT F/A and I continue to represent the organization I love so much|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2022-02-11|author=[[gabee]]}}</ref><ref name="+mari">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1492154481991106564|title=Bem-vinda à FURIA, @maripreste_!|trans_title=Welcome to FURIA, @maripreste_!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2022-02-11|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* September 28th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[gabee]] as she retires from competitive ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]''. <ref name="-gabee">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/gabeecsgo/status/1575246614381400069|title=Hoje me despeço da @FURIA|trans_title=Today I say goodbye to @FURIA|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2022-09-28|author=[[gabee]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 14th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[bokor]] as [[mari]] is acquired by [[w7m esports Female]]. <ref name="+bokor">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1614326918823780357|title=Conheçam a mais nova jogadora da #FURIACS Feminina!|trans_title=Meet the newest female #FURIACS player!|date=2023-01-14|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref><ref name="-mari">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/w7mesports/status/1614336546206785536|title=Nesse novo ano de 2023, chegamos com um compromisso|trans_title=In this new year of 2023, we arrived with a commitment|date=2023-01-14|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[w7m esports Female]]}}</ref>
* March 9th - [[olga]] is acquired by [[HSG]]. <ref name="olga leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/HSGfe_/status/1633866109391880192|title=Welcoming the one and only icon @olgacsgo to HSG.Esports new roster & Família|author=[[HSG]]|date=2023-03-09}}</ref>
* March 15th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' re-sign [[gabs]]. <ref name="+gabs">{{inside source|date=2023-05-28|source=Alexia Midori}}</ref>
* May 4th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[segalla]]. <ref name="-segalla">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1654208857558720514|title=Hoje nos despedimos do @segallafps|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @segallafps|date=2023-05-04|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[RMN]] as their new coach. <ref name="+RMN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1654864093335961600|title=Damos as boas vindas ao novo técnico da #FURIACS Fem!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=We welcome the new coach of #FURIACS Fem!|date=2023-05-06|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 19th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[bokor]]. <ref name="-bokor">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1670847012093280301|title=Hoje nos despedimos da bokor na #FURIACS Feminina|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to bokor at #FURIACS Female|date=2023-06-19|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* July 10th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[annaEX]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+annaEX">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1678434282832908289|title=Achamos a annaEX!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=We found annaEX!|date=2023-07-10|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* February 9th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[annaEX]]. <ref name="-annaEX">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1756037376491590110|title=Hoje nos despedimos da @annaEX_ na lineup ativa da #FURIACS Fem|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @annaEX_ in the #FURIACS Fem active lineup|date=2024-02-09|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* February 23rd - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[bizinha]]. <ref name="+bizinha">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1761091271949517171|title=O retorno de uma das maiores vencedoras do CS brasileiro|trans_title=The return of one of the biggest winners of Brazilian CS|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-02-23|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* May 7th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[GaBi]]. <ref name="-GaBi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/FURIA/status/1787887577682366868|title=Hoje nos despedimos da @gabiifps|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @gabiifps|date=2024-05-07|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* May 14th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' part ways with [[RMN]]. <ref name="-RMN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/furia/status/1790426853330808839|title=Hoje nos despedimos do @RMNfps|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @RMNfps|date=2024-05-14|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* June 25th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[lulitenz]]. <ref name="+lulitenz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FURIA/status/1805632045617475688|title=Seja bem-vinda à FURIA, @LuDubra!|trans_title=Welcome to FURIA, @LuDubra!|date=2024-06-25|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>
* July 25th - '''FURIA Esports Female''' sign [[jnt]] as their new coach. <ref name="+jnt">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FURIA/status/1816550104528007346|title=Seja bem-vindo à FURIA, @fpsjnt!|trans_title=Welcome to FURIA, @fpsjnt!|date=2024-07-25|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[FURIA Esports]]}}</ref>

|content6=
