|content7=
* August 17th - '''FURIA Female''' transfer their ''Counter-Strike 2'' division to ''VALORANT''. <ref name="-furia 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/FURIA/status/2089393689420259839|title=A #FURIACS Fe AGORA É #FURIAVAL Inclusivo!|trans_title=#FURIACS is now the inclusive #FURIAVAL!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-08-17|author=[[FURIA]]}}</ref>
