'''Fake do Biru''' was an organization-less [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team that was initially formed in January 2025 by players that would go on to be signed by [[2Game Esports]]. It was reformed after [[2Game Esports]] released their team.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2
|content1=
* February 27th - '''Fake do Biru''', with the exception of [[Machado]], are signed by [[2Game Esports]]. <ref name="2Game 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/2GAMEgg/status/1895217346052268277|date=2025-02-27|title=CHEGAMOS COM NOSSA LINE DE CS2!|trans_title=WE'RE HERE WITH OUR CS2 LINE!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author=[[2Game Esports]]}}</ref>
* October 8th - '''Fake do Biru''' reforms with a roster consisting of [[hardzao]], [[PKL]], [[xureba]], [[lukiz]], [[detr0ittJ]], and [[turner]], the latter as the team's coach, after [[2Game Esports]] exit ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]''. <ref name="fake do biru reform">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/turnercs2/status/1976059468950786338|date=2025-10-08|title=After 2Game’s decision to end its CS2 project, our team is now free agent and looking for a new home|author=[[Turner]]}}</ref>
* October 28th - [[lukiz]] steps down from '''Fake do Biru'''. <ref name="-lukiz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/lukizJESUS/status/1983228756043985084|date=2025-10-28|trans_title=Today I bid farewell to my teammates from ex-2Game|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|title=Hoje me despeço dos meus companheiros da ex-2Game|author=[[lukiz]]}}</ref>
* November 22nd - [[xureba]] steps down from '''Fake do Biru'''. <ref name="-xureba">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/xrbfps/status/1992272637960036478|date=2025-11-22|trans_title=After a year playing with the folks from ex-2game, I'm closing my cycle with them|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|title=Depois de um ano jogando com o pessoal da ex-2game, encerro meu ciclo com eles|author=[[xureba]]}}</ref>
|content2=
