* June 26th - [[kl1m]]'s loan to [[MIBR]] expires and he returns to the bench. <ref name="kl1m return">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/MIBR/status/2070507380433932320|title=UPDATE NO #MIBRCS|trans_title=UPDATE ON #MIBRCS|language={{flag|br}} Portguese|date=2026-06-26|author=[[MIBR]]}}</ref>
* August 28th - '''G2 Ares''' loan [[tAk]] to [[BRUTE]]. <ref name="tAk loan">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/G2CSGO/status/2093398652135878846|title=G2 Ares roster update: @takesh1cs will be joining @brute_gg1 on a loan|date=2026-08-28|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
* October 6th - '''G2 Ares''' acquire [[TMKj]] from [[Rebels Gaming]]. <ref name="+TMKj">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/G2CSGO/status/2107523397458747580|title=A new addition to the arsenal|date=2026-10-06|author=[[G2 Esports]]}}</ref>
