'''Galorys''' is a [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* January 19th - '''Galorys''' sign [[Filhos de D10S]], a lineup consisting of [[detr0ittJ]], [[ninjaZ]], [[koala]], [[hoax]], [[happ]] and [[D10S]], the latter as coach. <ref name="Filhos de D10S">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/galorysgg/status/1748408803446452357|title=O suspense foi real e demorou um pouquinho, mas finalmente podemos revelar que o nosso treinador lusitano @D10S_Official trouxe seus “filhos” para nos representar no cenário de Counter Strike|trans_title=The suspense was real and it took a while, but we can finally reveal that our Portuguese coach @D10S_Official brought his “sons” to represent us in the Counter Strike scene|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-01-19|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* May 21st - [[koala]] is acquired by [[Sharks Esports]]. <ref name="-koala">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/sharksesportsgg/status/1793031515137532157|title=Tem tubarão novo na área|trans_title=There's a new shark in the area|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-05-21|author=[[Sharks Esports]]}}</ref>
* May 27th - '''Galorys''' acquire [[tomate]] from [[9z Academy]]. <ref name="+tomate">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1795086596007481683|title=Seja Bem-vindo TOMATE|trans_title=Welcome TOMATE|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-05-27|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* August 14th - '''Galorys''' bench [[hoax]] and [[happ]] as they acquire [[xureba]] on loan from [[Team Solid]] and sign [[delboNi]]. <ref name="hoax happ bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/D10S_Official/status/1823843339784868260|title=Oito meses depois, talvez um pouco tarde, talvez no timming certo, chegou a hora de mudar|trans_title=Eight months later, maybe a little late, maybe at the right timing, the time has come for a change|language={{Flag|pt}} Portuguese|date=2024-08-14|author=[[D10S]]}}</ref><ref name="+xureba +delboNi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1823825275584700555|title=O novo reforço do CS2 da Galorys|trans_title=Galorys' new CS2 booster|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-08-14|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''Galorys''' release [[happ]]. <ref name="-happ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/happfps/status/1824824794799354247|title=Salve guys como alguns já sabem não faço mais parte da @galorysgg|trans_title=Hi guys, as some of you already know, I'm no longer part of @galorysgg|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-08-17|author=[[happ]]}}</ref>
* September 1st - '''Galorys''' release [[hoax]]. <ref name="-hoax">{{inside source|date=2024-09-02|source=hoax}}</ref>
* October 7th - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[delboNi]]. <ref name="-delboNi">{{inside source|date=2024-10-21|source=delboNi}}</ref>
* October 23rd - '''Galorys''' bench their players as they evaluate options for the upcoming year. <ref name="October 2024">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1849151074516512977|title=O time principal de Counter-Strike 2 voltará no ano que vem ainda MAIOR!|trans_title=The Counter-Strike 2 main team will be back next year and even BIGGER!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-10-23|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* November 15th - [[ninjaZ]] is acquired by [[Hype Esports]]. <ref name="-ninjaZ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gohypeclan/status/1857483527933276232|title=EU ESCOLHI NÃO ESPERAR POR SUA CAUSA!|trans_title=I CHOSE NOT TO WAIT BECAUSE OF YOU!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-11-15|author=[[Hype Esports]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 2nd - '''Galorys''' release [[detr0ittJ]]. <ref name="-detr0ittJ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/detr0ittJ/status/1874888800029360524|title=Oficialmente F/A - livre de contrato|trans_title=Officially F/A - free of contract|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-01-02|author=[[detr0ittJ]]}}</ref>
* January 15th - '''Galorys''' release [[xureba]] as he is recalled by [[Team Solid]]. <ref name="-xureba">{{inside source|date=2025-02-03|source=Phael}}</ref>
* January 16th - '''Galorys''' promote [[Kadzz]], [[bacc]], and [[reg1no.O]] from [[Galorys Academy|their academy]], the latter as an analyst. Additionally, they acquire [[pepe]] from [[Sharks Esports]] and sign [[divine (Brazilian player)|divine]] and [[Alisson]]. <ref name="January 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1879940717662859754|title=Chegou a hora de revelar o novo time de Counter-Strike da Galorys!|trans_title=It's time to reveal Galorys' new Counter-Strike team!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-01-16|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* February 11th - '''Galorys''' loan [[tomate]] to [[Team Solid]]. <ref name="tomate loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamSolid_of/status/1889434217294991486|title=EU SÓ DE CANTO OBSERVANDO ESSA…!|trans_title=I'M JUST IN THE CORNER WATCHING THIS...!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-02-11|author=[[Team Solid]]}}</ref>
* May 23rd -  [[tomate]] returns to the bench as [[Team Solid]] disbands. <ref name="Team Solid disband">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamSolid_of/status/1926004938032787898|title=Comunicamos oficialmente a pausa do nosso projeto no cenário de Counter-Strike 2|trans_title=We officially announce the pause of our project in the Counter-Strike 2 scene|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-05-23|author=[[Team Solid]]}}</ref>
* August 27th - '''Galorys''' bench their roster exception of [[D10S]]. <ref name="roster benched">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.com.br/noticias/65121/galorys-poe-quinteto-no-banco-e-negocia-com-reforcos|title=Galorys põe quinteto no banco e negocia com reforços|trans_title=Galorys benches quintet and negotiates reinforcements|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-08-27|publisher=[[Dust2 Brasil]]|author=[[vhporto]]}}</ref>
* September 3rd - '''Galorys''' assemble a new roster consisting of [[tomate]], who is reinstated to the starting lineup, [[card]] from [[MIBR Academy]], [[gbb]] and [[nython]] from [[Team Solid]], and [[destiny]]. <ref name="new galorys roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1963270060497121285|title=Agora é oficial!|trans_title=It's official now!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-09-03|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* October 24th - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[D10S]]. <ref name="-D10S">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/1981782766384472507|title=Obrigado, @D10S_Official !|trans_title=Thank you, @D10S_Official !|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-10-24|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* October 31st - '''Galorys''' release [[Alisson]]. <ref name="-Alisson">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Alissonfps1/status/1984297954165833924|title=Salve, rapaziada! Após 10 meses jogando na Galorys, Hoje anuncio que estou livre de contratos|trans_title=Hey guys! After 10 months playing at Galorys, today I announce that I am free from contracts.|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-10-31|author=[[Alisson]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 7th - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[card]]. <ref name="-card">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/2008932956526571567|title=Valeuuu demais, Card|trans_title=Thanks a lot, Card|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-01-07|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* January 16th - '''Galorys''' sign [[drg]]. <ref name="+drg">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/2012223558332579996|title=Bem-vindo a família, @drg_cs!|trans_title=Welcome to the family, @drg_cs!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-01-16|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* February 26th - [[pepe]] is acquired by [[Bounty Hunters Esports]]. <ref name="-pepe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bhbountyhunters/status/2027120823983640707|title=O reforço que faltava chegou!|trans_title=The reinforcement you needed has arrived!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-02-26|author=[[Bounty Hunters Esports]]}}</ref>
* April 23rd - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[drg]]. <ref name="-drg">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/2047398096254931056|title=Hoje nos despedimos de uma peça fundamental da nossa caminhada no CS2 em 2026|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to a key part of our journey in CS2 in 2026|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-04-23|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* April 24th - '''Galorys''' acquire [[k1not1]] on loan from [[BESTIA Academy]]. <ref name="+k1not1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/2047737918236525050|title=Bem-vindo, @k1not1fps|trans_title=Welcome, @k1not1fps|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-04-24|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* June 16th - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[destiny]]. <ref name="-destiny">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/destinyycsgo/status/2067005899378487700|title=Salve rapaziada!|trans_title=Hey folks!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-06-16|author=[[destiny]]}}</ref>
* July 24th - '''Galorys''' bench [[nython]] and [[k1not1]] while signing [[PKL]], [[detr0ittJ]], [[destiny]], and [[turner]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="galorys july 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/galorysgg/status/2080759967628263591|title=Sejam bem-vindos, PKL, detr0ittJ e Turner!|trans_title=Welcome, PKL, detr0ittJ, and Turner!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-07-24|author='''Galorys'''}}</ref>
* September 1st - '''Galorys''' part ways with [[k1not1]]. <ref name="-k1not1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/k1not1fps/status/2094816278212976985|title=Salve galera, infelizmente algumas questões contratuais dificultaram minha permanência no time da @galorysgg|trans_title=Hey everyone, unfortunately, some contractual issues made it difficult for me to stay with the @galorysgg team.|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-09-01|author=[[k1not1]]}}</ref>
}}

