|This=6

|content1=
* January 6th - '''GenOne''' is founded by [[KRL]] with a roster consisting of [[Brooxsy]], [[ElectuS]], [[Neityu]], [[Graviti]], and [[Saax]]. <ref name="CS">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1346893432774684673|title=Nouveau projet pour 2021|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=New project for 2021|date=2021-01-06|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
* March 17th - '''GenOne''' sign [[Aymeinstein]] as coach. <ref name="+Aymeinstein">{{inside source|date=2023-04-30|source=Aymeinstein}}</ref>
* July 15th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[Saax]]. <ref name="-Saax">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1415690904111882243|title=Notre @Saaxcsgo nous quitte suite a sa saison trop faible en terme de stats et de lead ou il ne sent pas à sa place dans aucun de ses 2 roles|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Our @Saaxcsgo leaves us following a weak season in terms of stats and lead where he feels out of place in both of his 2 roles|date=2021-07-15|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* July 27th - '''GenOne''' sign [[AZIDOT]]. <ref name="+AZI">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1420038800676433922|title=BIENVENUE CHEZ GENONE|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=WELCOME TO GENONE|date=2021-07-27|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* August 30th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[AZIDOT]] and sign [[Diviiii]]. <ref name="+Divi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1432403148451233794|title=Nous avons décidé de nous séparer d'Adel "Azidot" SAICH|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=We have decided to part ways with Adel "Azidot" SAICH|date=2021-08-30|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 16th - '''GenOne''' bench [[Neityu]]. <ref name="Neityu bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1482832376057286657|title=Il y a des décisions à prendre qui sont plus difficiles que d'autres|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=There are decisions to be made that are more difficult than others|date=2022-01-16|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* January 30th - '''GenOne'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s roster is acquired by [[Team LDLC]]. <ref name="LDLC">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/LDLC_OL/status/1487833737635061760|title=MAJ 2.022 : Équipe CS:GO|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Update 2.022: CS:GO Team|date=2022-01-30|author=[[Team LDLC]]}}</ref>
* March 6th - '''GenOne''' sign [[Tarkky]] and [[NeOo]]. <ref name="Tarky">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1500560164021223424|title=Bienvenue @Tarkky_B|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Welcome @Tarkky_B|date=2022-03-06|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref><ref name="NeO">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1500571231271239682|title=Le deuxième joueur GenTwo ne sera autre que @NeOo_CSGO, l'élu|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=The second GenTwo player will be none other than @NeOo_CSGO, the chosen one|date=2022-03-06|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
* March 16th - '''GenOne''' sign [[nonick]], [[Kursy]], and [[Revol]] to finalize their roster. <ref name="nonick">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1504139420865339395|title=On vous avait déjà annoncé 2 joueurs !!! Vous étiez impatient de connaître les 3 autres !!|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=We had already announced 2 players!!! You were impatient to know the other 3!!|date=2022-03-16|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* July 4th - '''GenOne''' replace [[Tarkky]] and [[Revol]] with [[Nono2k]] and [[jeyN]]. <ref name="+jeyN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1544036867741458432|title=Le staff Genone et son équipe a décidé de changer de roster après un peu plus de 3 mois avec celui-ci|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=The Genone staff and their team have decided to change their roster after a little over 3 months with this one|date=2022-07-04|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* July 29th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[Kursy]]. <ref name="-Kursy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1552992096843341825|title=Aujourd'hui @KursySSJ4 nous a fait part de son souhait de quitter l'équipe pour faire son propre projet et devenir Leader Ingame|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Today @KursySSJ4 told us of his wish to leave the team to create his own project and become an Ingame Leader|date=2022-07-29|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* July 31st - '''GenOne''' sign [[oqald]]. <ref name="+oqald">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1553814065205714948|title=Bienvenue à @oqald chez @GenOneEsport|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Welcome @oqald to @GenOneEsport|date=2022-07-31|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* October 3rd - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[nonick]] and [[oqald]] and sign [[wasiNk]] and [[SIXER]]. <ref name="-nonick -oqald">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1576913685208961024|title=Merci à nonick et oqald|trans_title=Thanks to nonick and oqald|language={{Flag|fr}} French|author='''GenOne'''|date=2022-10-03}}</ref><ref name="+wasink +sixer">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1576982662103040000|title=Il est temps de passer à la vitesse supérieure|trans_title=It's time to take it to the next level|language={{Flag|fr}} French|author='''GenOne'''|date=2022-10-03}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 7th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[Nono2K]]. <ref name="-Nono2K">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsport/status/1633063013405032448|title=Nous tenons à exprimer notre gratitude envers @N0no2K pour sa contribution et son engagement au sein de GenOne depuis le mois de Juillet|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=We would like to express our gratitude to  @N0no2K for its contribution and commitment to GenOne since July|date=2023-03-07|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* April 28th - '''GenOne''' part ways with their lineup and transition [[Aymeinstein]] to [[GenOne Academy]]. <ref name="End of the roster">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1651988205200191492|title=Fin de ce roster @GenOneEsport|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=The End of this roster @GenOneEsport|date=2023-04-28|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref><ref name="Aymeinstein academy">{{inside source|date=2023-04-29|source=KRL}}</ref>
* September 6th - '''GenOne''' sign [[ghoulsW]], a roster consisting of [[bibu]], [[Graviti]], [[Sterzig]], [[EIZA]], and [[DGL]]. <ref name="GhoulsW">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_stream/status/1699489989258584174|date=2023-09-06|title=LET'S GO BABY!!!|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
* October 2nd - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[DGL]]. <ref name="-DGL">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsports/status/1708780475651637430|date=2023-10-02|title=Roster Update|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* October 15th - '''GenOne''' sign [[aidKiT]]. <ref name="+aidkit">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/GenOneEsports/status/1713512510093947213|date=2023-10-15|title=Please give a warm welcome to @aidKiT_CS who will take over as our new starting AWP|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* December 9th - '''GenOne''' sign [[ioRek]] as the team's new head coach. <ref name="+ioRek">{{inside source|date=2023-12-09|source=ioRek}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 13th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[bibu]], [[Sterzig]], [[EIZA]], [[aidKiT]], and [[ioRek]]. <ref name="-4 players">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_STREAM/status/1746157062109659590|title=Aujourd'hui, nous mettons un terme au contrat avec Aidkit, Sterzig, Eiza et Bibu|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Today we are terminating our contracts with Aidkit, Sterzig, Eiza and Bibu|date=2024-01-13|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref><ref name="-iorek">{{inside source|date=2024-02-24|source=ioRek}}</ref>
* February 4th - '''GenOne''' sign [[Kursy]], [[AMANEK]], [[Brooxsy]], and [[Razzmo]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+4">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/KRL_STREAM/status/1754136549443162202|title=En 2024, @GenOneEsports arborera de nouveau les couleurs tricolores|trans_title=In 2024, @GenOneEsports will once again display the tricolor colors|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2024-02-04|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
* March 25th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[Razzmo]]. <ref name="-razzmo">{{inside source|source=KRL}}</ref>
* April 2nd - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[AMANEK]]. <ref name="-amanek">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/amanekcs2/status/1775230662405992873|title=After 2months with the team, I have decided to step down from GenOne due to the recent change|date=2024-04-02|author=[[AMANEK]]}}</ref>
* April 7th - '''GenOne''' sign [[devoduvek]], [[drac]], and [[unshaarK]]. <ref name="+3 2024">{{inside source|date=2024-04-07|source=KRL}}</ref>
* April 30th - [[Graviti]] is acquired by [[3DMAX]]. <ref name="-graviti">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/3DMAXGaming/status/1785338419473715669|title=The reinforcements have arrived!|date=2024-04-30|author=[[3DMAX]]}}</ref>
* September 5th - '''GenOne''' add [[JACKZ]] as a stand-in. <ref name="JACKZ stand-in">{{inside source|date=2025-04-29|source=limun}}</ref>
* October 20th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[unshaarK]]. <ref name="-unshaarK">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/unshaark/status/1848010062637178897|title=Bonjour X|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Hello X|date=2024-10-20|author=[[unshaarK]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* March 24th - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[Brooxsy]]. <ref name="-Brooxsy">{{inside source|date=2025-03-24|source=limun}}</ref>
* April 28th - '''GenOne''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-roster 2025">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/GenOneEsports/status/1916867011310665833|title=L'aventure entre @GenOneEsports et notre roster touche à sa fin|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=The adventure between @GenOneEsports and our roster is coming to an end|date=2025-04-28|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref>
* May 6th - '''GenOne''' sign the former [[Caldya Esport]]'s core consisting of [[cHeuuuuk]], [[Tarkky]], [[Chuckyy]], and [[JunioRRR]] as coach alongside [[Brooxsy]] and [[SLIE9000]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="GenOne 2025">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/GenOneEsports/status/1919704942580740261|title=Nouveau chapitre pour @GenOneEsports|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=New chapter for @GenOneEsports|date=2025-05-06|author='''GenOne'''}}</ref><ref name="+JunioRRR">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/JunioRTanK_/status/1919718793632239909|title=Content de pouvoir continuer d’accompagner les gars en tant que Head Coach dans cette aventure|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Glad to be able to continue supporting the guys as Head Coach in this adventure|date=2025-05-06|author=[[JunioRRR]]}}</ref>
* September 23rd - '''GenOne''' part ways with [[cHeuuuuk]], [[Tarkky]], [[SLIE9000]], and [[JunioRRR]] while acquiring [[misutaaa]] from [[FUT Esports]] and signing [[NBK-]], [[Djoko]] and [[wasiNk]], the latter as coach. <ref name="new roster 2025">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/KRL_STREAM/status/1970431968904102336|title=J'ai le plaisir de vous annoncer le nouveau roster @GenOneEsports|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=I have the pleasure to announce the new @GenOneEsports roster|date=2025-09-23|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>

|content6=
* February 24th - [[NBK-]], [[misutaaa]], and [[wasiNk]] are acquired by [[3DMAX]]. <ref name="-misutaaa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/3DMAXGaming/status/2026360109144691191|title=A new chapter begins|date=2026-02-24|author=[[3DMAX]]}}</ref><ref name="-NBK -wasiNk">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/3DMAXGaming/status/2026325927261532599|title=We’ve made an important decision regarding our 3DMAX staff team|date=2026-02-24|author=[[3DMAX]]}}</ref>
* July 22nd - '''GenOne''' sign [[Keoz]] and [[bL4SEZ]]. <ref name="+Keoz +bL4SEZ">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/KRL_STREAM/status/2079981789792043148|title=C'est officiel, tout le monde a signé|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=It's official, everyone has signed|date=2026-07-22|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
* October 4th - [[Chuckyy]] is acquired by [[OG]]. <ref name="-Chuckyy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/KRL_STREAM/status/2106815624731034036|title=Encore un joueur de @GenOneEsports qui s’envole vers d’autres horizons|language={{Flag|fr}} French|trans_title=Another @GenOneEsports player heading off to new horizons|date=2026-10-04|author=[[KRL]]}}</ref>
}}

